<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Pan Ocean TBN 130,000 tonnes Newcastle plus Gladstone/two trips South Korea 25/2-7/3 $7.21 fio seven days shinc Posco.</p>
<p>TBN 60,000 tonnes Hampton Roads/La Spezia 1-7/2 approx. $9.25 fio 30,000/10,000 Cobelfret.</p>
<p>Sea Magnolia - 60,000 tonnes Santa Marta/redcar end Jan $10.50 fio 8,000 shinc/20,000 shinc Mitsubishi Coal.</p>
<p>Ossolineum - 40,000 tonnes coke Xingang/Sepetiba Bay Jan $12.00 fio 4,000 shex/15,000 shinc Brazilian charterers.</p>
</text>
